    <section class="section" id="booking-types" aria-labelledby="booking-title"><div class="shell"><div class="section-intro reveal"><div><div class="section-kicker">Two ways to book</div><h2 id="booking-title">Choose cleaning time or a defined result.</h2></div><p>Both options are clear before booking. The difference is whether you are buying cleaning time or a service structured around the size of the home.</p></div><div class="booking-grid"><article class="booking-card reveal"><span class="booking-card__minimum">2-hour minimum</span><span class="booking-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3.5 2"></path></svg></span><h3>Hourly cleaning</h3><p>Book a set amount of team time and give us your priorities. We work through the list in order, starting with what matters most.</p><div class="booking-card__price"><strong>$60</strong><span>per hour</span></div></article><article class="booking-card reveal"><span class="booking-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M4 10 12 4l8 6v10H4z"></path><path d="M9 20v-6h6v6"></path></svg></span><h3>Flat rate cleaning</h3><p>Choose a defined service and the number of bedrooms. Your estimate covers that core clean, with optional extras added separately.</p><div class="booking-card__price"><strong>$155</strong><span>starting price</span></div></article></div></div></section>

    <section class="section section--soft" id="hourly" aria-labelledby="hourly-title"><div class="shell"><div class="section-intro reveal"><div><div class="section-kicker">Hourly cleaning</div><h2 id="hourly-title">Cleaning time, yours to prioritise.</h2></div><p>Hourly pricing is per booked team hour, with a minimum booking of two hours. Recurring rates begin from the second service.</p></div><div class="hourly-grid"><article class="rate-card reveal"><span class="rate-card__label">One-off</span><strong>$60<small>/h</small></strong><p>A flexible one-time clean with a two-hour minimum.</p></article><article class="rate-card rate-card--featured reveal"><span class="rate-card__pill">Best value · save 10%</span><span class="rate-card__label">Weekly or fortnightly</span><strong>$54<small>/h</small></strong><p>Our best hourly rate for a regular cleaning rhythm.</p></article><article class="rate-card reveal"><span class="rate-card__pill">Save 5%</span><span class="rate-card__label">Every 3 or 4 weeks</span><strong>$57<small>/h</small></strong><p>Regular support with a little more space between visits.</p></article></div><div class="team-hours reveal"><span class="team-hours__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3"></circle><circle cx="16" cy="8" r="3"></circle><path d="M3 20c0-4 2-6 5-6s5 2 5 6M11 20c0-4 2-6 5-6s5 2 5 6"></path></svg></span><div><strong>How team hours work</strong><p>Two cleaners for one hour equals two booked cleaning hours.</p></div><div class="team-hours__discount"><strong>Discount timing</strong><p>Recurring discounts apply from the second service. Your first clean is charged at the normal one-off rate.</p></div></div></div></section>

    <section class="section" id="flat-rate" aria-labelledby="flat-title"><div class="shell"><div class="section-intro reveal"><div><div class="section-kicker">Flat rate cleaning</div><h2 id="flat-title">Flat prices by home and service.</h2></div><p>Use this table as a starting point for the core clean. Select the service first, then add any optional extras separately.</p></div><div class="price-table-wrap reveal" tabindex="0" aria-label="Scrollable flat rate price table"><table class="price-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Service</th><th scope="col">1 bedroom</th><th scope="col">2 bedrooms</th><th scope="col">3 bedrooms</th><th scope="col">4 bedrooms</th><th scope="col">5 bedrooms</th><th scope="col">6 bedrooms</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Standard clean</strong><span>Everyday home maintenance · one-off or recurring</span></td><td>$155</td><td>$175</td><td>$195</td><td>$235</td><td>$285</td><td>$315</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Deep clean</strong><span>More time and detailed attention</span></td><td>$215</td><td>$245</td><td>$275</td><td>$315</td><td>$375</td><td>$415</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Move in clean</strong><span>A fresh start before settling in</span></td><td>$410</td><td>$440</td><td>$500</td><td>$570</td><td>$670</td><td>$710</td></tr><tr><td><strong>End of lease</strong><span>Inspection-focused vacate clean</span></td><td>$410</td><td>$440</td><td>$500</td><td>$570</td><td>$670</td><td>$710</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="estimate-note reveal"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 11v6M12 7h.01"></path></svg><p><strong>These are estimated core-service prices, reviewed July 2026.</strong> They do not include any optional extras you may add now or in the future.</p></div></div></section>

    <section class="section calculator-section" id="price-calculator" aria-labelledby="calculator-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="calculator-heading reveal">
          <div class="section-kicker">Instant price calculator</div>
